<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">We are sorry to hear that you want to make a claim on your policy, we need to speak to you to take all information to log the claim.</span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">We will attempt to call you or alternatively, please let us know the best time and/or day to speak to you.&nbsp;</span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Our service team are available from 09:000 to 18:00 Monday to Friday (excluding bank holidays)</span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">We look forward to speaking to you.</span></p>
